# AbleSharp.GUI - Desktop Application Rules

## Purpose
AbleSharp.GUI is a cross-platform desktop application for visual project manipulation, built with Avalonia UI framework and following MVVM pattern with ReactiveUI.

## Architecture

### Project Structure
```
AbleSharp.GUI/
├── Commands/           # ICommand implementations
├── Constants/          # Application constants
├── Converters/         # Value converters for XAML binding
├── Services/           # Application services (logging, dialogs)
├── Styles/             # XAML styles
├── Utils/              # Utility classes
├── ViewModels/         # MVVM ViewModels
│   ├── App/           # Application-level ViewModels
│   ├── Project/       # Project-related ViewModels
│   ├── Timeline/      # Timeline ViewModels
│   └── Tools/         # Tool ViewModels
├── Views/              # XAML Views
│   ├── App/           # Application windows
│   ├── Project/       # Project views
│   └── Tools/         # Tool windows
├── App.axaml           # Application XAML
├── App.axaml.cs        # Application code-behind
└── Program.cs          # Entry point
```

## Framework: Avalonia UI

### Avalonia Basics
- Version: 11.2.3
- Cross-platform XAML-based UI framework (.NET)
